---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NavBar from '../../components/NavBar.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <NavBar />
  <h1 class="mb-6 font-serif text-4xl font-bold">Flippo Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy explains how Flippo collects, uses, and safeguards
      information when you use the Flippo application and related services.
    </p>
    <p>
      Flippo is primarily a developer-focused tool and does not intentionally
      collect personal information beyond what is necessary to provide and
      improve the service. Any logs or configuration data generated by Flippo
      are intended for development and operational purposes.
    </p>
    <p>
      You are responsible for ensuring that any projects you build with Flippo
      comply with applicable privacy laws and clearly communicate their own
      data practices to end users.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
      Note: This is a basic placeholder policy. Update this content with your
      specific data handling practices and legal requirements.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
